    "Lender count inconsistency: The memo says the amendment involves a syndicate of eight lenders led by Bank of America, yet it lists eight additional participating lenders (Wells Fargo, PNC, TD, HSBC USA, BMO Harris, Citibank, JPMorgan, Bank of East Asia), implying nine in total.",
    "Fiscal quarter labeling contradiction: It states 'Q1 FY2024 (ended 1/27/24)' and also 'Q4 FY2024 (ended 4/27/24)'; Q1 cannot end after Q4 in the same fiscal year. The 1/27/24 date aligns with Q3, not Q1."
